achable to people. Despite his strength and ability, he is still like a child in some aspects. He usually behaves narcissistically.  For his sister, he often helped her with gossip about her being bad, and he feels a little tired about this. They have a good relationship.\n\nFor costume, please draw \"02\" the pirate version. You don't need to draw any hat or weapons if you don't want to.\n\nThank you for your consideration!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/19aAlUWJsKu_W60XsOV6Qm0LQ2VIiQqAE", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@inuboe_npa/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3392863, "client_id": 667554, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e912f89b/uploads/origins/b1bb4a52-edd4-4e6d-a14c-354ea143fd36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dca199c91ec4679c56e01f8d8645c826", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e912f89b/uploads/origins/b1bb4a52-edd4-4e6d-a14c-354ea143fd36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dca199c91ec4679c56e01f8d8645c826, https://si.imgix.net/e912f89b/uploads/origins/b1bb4a52-edd4-4e6d-a14c-354ea143fd36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4f8b20d38d2be1a958f1c074c420b8b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e912f89b/uploads/origins/b1bb4a52-edd4-4e6d-a14c-354ea143fd36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=898b5d613cc5077446107f892b976e01 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e912f89b/uploads/origins/b1bb4a52-edd4-4e6d-a14c-354ea143fd36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=98846c8f4665839494bd6c7f6e473376", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e912f89b/uploads/origins/b1bb4a52-edd4-4e6d-a14c-354ea143fd36?bg=%